6.10a04 (5 Aug 2010):
 - Set minimum value of u0.X_flag to -1 instead of 0, allowing flag to take on
    values -1, 0, and 1.  Update -S flag comment.  (unzip.c) [SMS]
 - Change vms_unzip_cmdline() from ulg to unsigned.  (unzpriv.h) [SMS]
